{"externalId":"88782","title":"Early Islam","issuedDate":"2023","language":"en","locc":null,"creators":[{"name":"Shoemaker, Stephen J","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Fisher, Greg","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Wood, Philip","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Reed, Annette Yoshiko","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"courtieu, gilles","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Hoffmann, Thomas","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Fedeli, Alba","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Neuenkirchen, Paul","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Pohlmann, Karl-Friedrich","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Dye, Guillaume","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Oliver, Isaac W.","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null},{"name":"Mårtensson, Ulrika","birthYear":null,"deathYear":null}],"subjects":[],"bookshelves":["Category: History and Archaeology","Category: Philosophy and Religion"],"formats":[{"url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/88782/1/1814-PHR-WEB.pdf","formatType":"pdf"},{"url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/88782/7/1814-PHR-WEB.pdf.txt","formatType":"txt"}],"lastModified":"2025-03-20","summary":"These studies explore the history of the Qur'ān and of formative Islam, with the methodological tools set forth in Biblical, New Testament and Apocryphal studies, as well as the approaches used in the study of Second Temple Judaism, Christian and Rabbinic origins. It thereby contributes to the interdisciplinary study of formative Islam as part and parcel of the religious landscape of Late Antiquity.","coverUrl":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/88782/2/1814-PHR-WEB.pdf.jpg"}